title: Milicja PPS
subtitle: Recruit, militarise, or reorganise the self-defence as Akcja Socjalistyczna.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.militiaAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.militia (technical reference 13.3–13.4; card catalogue 5.2): two basic steps and a
// conditional reorganisation; the same steps as in the card Organisations of PPS, with the same cooldowns.
PolishParty.partyDisplay(Q);
Q.pl_mil_recruit_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'recruit').reason;
Q.pl_mil_militarize_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'militarize').reason;
Q.pl_mil_as_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'as').reason;
!}

= Milicja PPS

[+ pl_party_militia +]. The upkeep is 0.10 R a month for every 200 members (0.10 R more after AS). An unfinanced month adds 5 fatigue.

- @recruit
- @militarize
- @form_as
- @easy_discard

@recruit
title: Recruit
subtitle: 1 R; +100 members, no efficiency bonus. Waits 2 months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'recruit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_recruit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'recruit');
!}
go-to: result

@militarize
title: Militarise
subtitle: 2 R; training and discipline: efficiency +0.10, up to 0.70. The first time, Centrum dissent +3. Waits 3 months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'militarize').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_militarize_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'militarize');
!}
go-to: result

@form_as
title: Reorganise as Akcja Socjalistyczna
subtitle: 2 R, once; needs a militarised Milicja of at least 500, legality, no arrears and a reserve. Members follow a call better (+0.15); up to three cases at once before a coup.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'as').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_as_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'as');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Milicja PPS

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
